    "content": "Help Center How can we help? Search help articles 17 results Popular: payments domain AuraMenu All 17 Getting started 4 AuraHub 2 Payments 3 Websites & domains 3 AuraMenu 3 WhatsApp & AI 2 Getting started How do I start with AuraDigital? + Click “Start your path”, answer a few questions from Auri and get your free roadmap. You can then order services yourself or ask our team to do it. Was this helpful? Yes No Getting started Do I need technical skills? + No. Auri guides you step by step and our team can handle everything for you. Was this helpful? Yes No Getting started Which languages do you support? + Turkish, English, Arabic and French for websites, menus and customer messages. Was this helpful? Yes No Getting started How much does a website cost? + Launch ₺6,750 (up to 3 pages), Growth ₺13,400 (4–10 pages), System ₺22,400 (dashboard and logins). Online store or booking sites from ₺26,900. Taxes are confirmed in your proposal. Was this helpful? Yes No AuraHub What can I do in AuraHub? + Follow your roadmap, see active services, send and approve requests, pay invoices, track deliveries and renewals, and chat with Auri or the team. Was this helpful? Yes No AuraHub How do I request a change to my website? + In AuraHub open Requests → New request, describe the change and attach files. You will see it move from Pending to In review to Approved. Was this helpful? Yes No Payments How do payments work? + Every project starts with a written proposal confirming scope, price, taxes and payment terms before work begins. Was this helpful? Yes No Payments Are prices tax-inclusive? +",
