    "content": "Taxes are confirmed in each individual proposal — do not assume tax-inclusive pricing. Was this helpful? Yes No Payments What do care plans cost? + Essential Care ₺1,950/month, Business Care ₺4,900, Growth Care ₺7,900, Managed Growth ₺12,900. Was this helpful? Yes No Websites & domains How long does a website take? + It depends on scope and how quickly we receive your content — small sites can launch within days. You follow every step in AuraHub. Was this helpful? Yes No Websites & domains What does hosting cost? + Standard hosting, an eligible domain and baseline security cost ₺2,000/year (included in the first year of System and above). Was this helpful? Yes No Websites & domains What happens when hosting renews? + AuraHub reminds you before each renewal date so your site never goes offline. Was this helpful? Yes No AuraMenu How much is AuraMenu? + Self-service ₺1,599 or done-for-you ₺2,500, one-time. Was this helpful? Yes No AuraMenu How do I update prices on my menu? + Send a request in AuraHub or edit items yourself with self-service. Changes appear instantly — no reprinting. Was this helpful? Yes No AuraMenu Can my menu be in Arabic? + Yes — Turkish, English and Arabic with right-to-left layout. Was this helpful? Yes No WhatsApp & AI Will the WhatsApp bot replace my staff? + No — it answers common questions and books appointments, then passes real conversations to you. Was this helpful? Yes No WhatsApp & AI Which WhatsApp do I need? + A WhatsApp Business number connected to the official WhatsApp Cloud API. We set it up for you. Was this helpful? Yes No Still need",
